    "pages": [
        {
            "id": "greeting",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Many thanks for coming all the way from Vaniville Town! I'm Professor Sycamore!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page2');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page2",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "It's a pleasure to finally meet you! How is your Pokémon journey going so far?"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page3');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page3",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Have you met many different Pokémon?"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page4');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page4",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Fantastic! Let me have a quick look at your Pokédex and see!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page5');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page5",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Well now, you DO have a certain je ne sais quoi!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page6');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page6",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "I have a good feeling about you!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page7');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page7",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "At first, I was thinking of choosing only one child from a town when I was deciding who to give a Pokémon to."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page8');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page8",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "In Vaniville Town, it was going to be the child of a Veteran Trainer I know."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page9');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page9",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "About then, I learned that the Rhyhorn racer Grace and her child were moving here."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page10');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page10",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Here in the Kalos region, you're far away from everything you used to know..."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page11');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page11",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "That really hit me right here..."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page12');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page12",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Then it hit me--I should give you a Pokémon and have you travel around Kalos!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page13');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page13",
            "speaker": "shauna",
            "lines": [
                "Hi, Professor! It's Shauna."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.run_command('execute as ' + q.player.username + ' unless entity @e[x=-261,y=121,z=97,dy=3,type=cobblemon:npc] run npcspawnat -261 121 97 shauna_generic');",
                            "q.run_command('execute as ' + q.player.username + ' unless entity @e[x=-263,y=121,z=97,dy=3,type=cobblemon:npc] run npcspawnat -263 121 97 serena_generic');",
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page14');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page14",
            "speaker": "serena",
            "lines": [
                "Sorry to have kept you waiting."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page15');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page15",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Fantastic! Now, let's all have a Pokémon battle!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page16');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page16",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Your opponent shall be me!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "§c⚔ Battle ⚔§r",
                        "value": "battle",
                        "action": [
                            "q.run_command('tag ' + q.player.username + ' remove InDialogue');",
                            "q.run_command('scoreboard players set ' + q.player.username + ' BattleStart 27');",
                            "q.run_command('execute as ' + q.player.username + ' run function kalos:triggers/stopsound');",
                            "v.battle = q.npc.start_battle(q.player);"
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "text": "No",
                        "value": "no",
                        "action": [
                            "q.run_command('tag ' + q.player.username + ' remove InDialogue');",
                            "q.run_command('scoreboard players set ' + q.player.username + ' BattleStart 0');",
                            "q.run_command('execute as ' + q.player.username + ' run function kalos:triggers/stopsound');",
                            "q.dialogue.close();"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        }
    ]
}